# Arcane Adaptation: "As this enchantment enters, choose a creature type. Creatures you control are the chosen type in
# addition to their other types. The same is true for creature spells you control and creature cards you own that aren't
# on the battlefield." Bot1 chooses Merfolk (CR 614.12a). A static ability that says so works on objects in every zone
# (CR 611.3a), in layer 4, adding the type and keeping the others (CR 205.1b): Bot1's Llanowar Elves is an Elf Druid Merfolk,
# the Doomed Traveler in Bot1's hand a Human Cleric Merfolk, the Walking Ballista in its graveyard (cast for X = 0) a
# Construct Merfolk, the Ornithopter on top of its library a Thopter Merfolk. Bot2's creatures are not Bot1's: its Llanowar
# Elves and the Doomed Traveler in its hand keep their types alone.

